-center justify-start gap-2 flex-initial"><span>Built-in Optimizations</span></div><div data-subtitle="true">Automatic Image, Font, and Script Optimizations for improved UX and Core Web Vitals.</div></a><!--/$--><a aria-label="React Server Components" class="KQTBcq_card" data-variant="callout" href="/docs/app/getting-started/server-and-client-components"><div data-illustration="true"><img alt="A tree structure of 3D spheres are connected by lines" loading="lazy" width="268" height="212" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="KQTBcq_lightMode" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-light.png&amp;w=300&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-light.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-light.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"><img alt="A tree structure of 3D spheres are connected by lines" loading="lazy" width="268" height="212" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="KQTBcq_darkMode" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-dark.png&amp;w=300&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-dark.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fh8DxKfmAPhn8O0p3.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fnextjs%2Fspheres-dark.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"></div><div data-title="true" class="flex flex-row items-center justify-start gap-2 flex-initial"><span>React Server Components</span></div><div data-subtitle="true">Add components without sending additional client-side JavaScript. Built on the latest React features.</div></a><a aria-label="Data Fetching" class="KQTBcq_card" data-variant="minimal" href="/docs/app/getting-started/fetching-data"><div data-title="true" class="flex flex-r